OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after viable device
OL,4,Afound
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 20s has been arrested
OL,7,Fafter a viable device was found in
OL,8,FCounty Armagh.
OL,10,FPolice were called to the Carrive Road
OL,11,Farea of Silverbridge shortly after
OL,12,F08:45 BST on Saturday.
OL,14,FA controlled explosion was later
OL,15,Fcarried out on the device by ammunition
OL,16,Ftechnical officers.
OL,18,FRoad closures which were put in place
OL,19,Fduring the security alert have since
OL,20,Fbeen lifted.
